    "5e-english-must-have-to-q4",
    "5e-english-must-have-to-q5"
   ],
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Obligation",
     "md": "**must** + infinitif sans to : You **must** wear a uniform. (obligation forte, règle)\n**have to** / **has to** : She **has to** get up early. (obligation venant des circonstances)\nPas de -s pour must ; **has to** à he/she/it."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "Interdiction ou absence d'obligation",
     "md": "- **mustn't** = **interdit** : You **mustn't** run in the corridor.\n- **don't have to** / **doesn't have to** = **pas obligé** (c'est permis, mais pas nécessaire) : You **don't have to** wear a tie.\nAttention : ce n'est pas le même sens !"
    },
